    "statement": "There was a lack of direct evaluations for the effect of size limits on recreationally caught invertebrate species.",
    "citations": [
      "2274"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "Gear selectivity modifications offer alternatives to reduce the mortality of non-target or undersized fish.",
    "citations": []
  },
  {
    "statement": "Fitting trawl nets with escape panels, windows, and size-sorting grids can reduce unwanted catches.",
